{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n 'missingX|interface PointSeries|class PointStore|F2 scatter' packages/axylo reviews/2026-11-18/impl/wp/reader-fix-2.report.md\"","aggregated_output":"reviews/2026-11-18/impl/wp/reader-fix-2.report.md:16:**Scatter rows.** `PointSeries.x`, `y`, and `row` cover the retained points. `RowSource.rowAt` requires a known source index and cannot enumerate the omitted observations. The smallest addition for table display is `readonly missingX?: Float64Array` on `PointSeries`, sorted by normalized x with one entry per row whose x is valid and whose y is null or absent. Duplicate x positions stay in the array and series membership comes from the owning `PointSeries`. The reader can merge those positions within `ScatterView.xDomain` into paging and render `messages.noData`. [Frame contracts](/home/canarit/projects/axylo/packages/axylo/src/core/contracts.ts:87) · [Scatter table](/home/canarit/projects/axylo/packages/axylo/src/reader/table.ts:55)\nreviews/2026-11-18/impl/wp/reader-fix-2.report.md:18:**Verification.** The requested combined run exited 1. Its remaining failures were the three A4 cases above, five A10 authored-warning cases that expect `Ausgelassen: 1.` without the newly required suffix, two F2 scatter missing-value cases, one F4 scatter date-precision case, two F7 scatter percent/ratio cases, four F7 first-drawn-tick cases, and five L3 zero-size cases that recorded an empty draw after concurrent controller changes.\npackages/axylo/src/data/store-unaligned.ts:417:export class PointStore extends UnalignedStore<PointFrame> {\npackages/axylo/src/core/contracts.ts:112:export interface PointSeries {\npackages/axylo/src/core/contracts.ts:126:  readonly missingX?: Float64Array;\npackages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/f2-gaps.browser.test.ts:144:  it('F2 scatter: a point with a missing y is not drawn (never at zero) and the keyboard skips it', async () => {\npackages/axylo/test/acceptance/REPORT.md:105:### F2 scatter omissions and zero imputation\npackages/axylo/test/acceptance/REPORT.md:111:- **F2 scatter: gaps are unplotted, zero is readable and the table says No data (reading: the table keeps omitted observations)**  \npackages/axylo/test/acceptance/REPORT.md:113:- **F2 scatter: missing zero draws two imputed zero points and exposes all four observations**  \npackages/axylo/test/acceptance/f-missing-values.test.ts:126:it('F2 scatter: gaps are unplotted, zero is readable and the table says No data (reading: the table keeps omitted observations)', () => {\npackages/axylo/test/acceptance/f-missing-values.test.ts:138:it('F2 scatter: missing zero draws two imputed zero points and exposes all four observations', () => {\npackages/axylo/test/acceptance/EVIDENCE.json:292:  {\"criterion\":\"F2\",\"type\":\"scatter\",\"file\":\"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/f-missing-values.test.ts\",\"title\":\"F2 scatter: gaps are unplotted, zero is readable and the table says No data (reading: the table keeps omitted observations)\"},\npackages/axylo/test/acceptance/EVIDENCE.json:293:  {\"criterion\":\"F2\",\"type\":\"scatter\",\"file\":\"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/f-missing-values.test.ts\",\"title\":\"F2 scatter: missing zero draws two imputed zero points and exposes all four observations\"},\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
